; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Latvian / Latviešu (lv)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

parvietot counter 5

launch_loop:
sistemas_izsaukums counter
atnemt counter 1
salidzinat counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
parvietot box 999
sistemas_izsaukums box
